# 📚 Book REST API

A simple, educational REST API for managing books using **Node.js** and **Express.js**.

This project demonstrates core REST API concepts including CRUD operations, middleware,
error handling, input validation, and query parameter filtering—all with detailed
comments explaining every design decision.

